s": null, "text": "I paid Delta Printworks invoice INV-99625 in full by wire. The payment ID is **PAY0001**, for $7,401.36, and its status is \"sent.\"\n\nI sent it once, using an idempotency key so a retry couldn't pay it twice. The amount is under the $10,000 threshold, so no controller approval was needed. The vendor accepts wire and is bank-verified, so ACH wasn't necessary.\n\nDelta Printworks has two other invoices I left alone: INV-86330 is already paid, and INV-99666 ($5,586.95) is still a draft awaiting approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}